# CSS ownership model

Strict four-layer appearance stack. **globals.css is not a layer** — import-only bootstrap per app surface.

## Layers

| Layer | Package | Owns | Forbidden |
| ----- | ------- | ---- | --------- |
| **L0 Tokens** | `@app-tour/design-tokens` (`primitives`, `semantics`, `themes`) | `--color-*`, `--space-*`, `--radius` | `data-*` selectors, page rules |
| **L1 Primitives** | `@app-tour/ui-primitives` | Atom CSS modules bound to L0 | Shell hooks, workspace scope |
| **L2 Shell** | `design-tokens` bootstrap fallbacks (`fallback-guest-*`, `operator-admin-appearance` structure) | Layout on `data-slot` / `data-*` hooks | Brand hex colors, workspace names |
| **L3 Skin** | `packages/workspaces/<id>/theme/` | Scoped overrides on `body[data-app-surface][data-workspace-plugin]` | `:root` unscoped tokens, `!important` (except Radix escape allowlist) |

## Bootstrap manifests (globals.css imports)

| App | Bootstrap entry | Imports |
| --- | --------------- | ------- |
| Portal | `portal-bootstrap.css` | L0 index + shell-bridge + portal shell fallback + body reset + platform infra (no L3 skin) |
| Marketing | `marketing-bootstrap.css` | L0 index + shell-bridge + marketing shell fallback + body reset + platform infra |
| Admin (`apps/web`) | `admin-bootstrap.css` | L0 index + shell-bridge + operator-shell-structure + operator-admin-appearance |

**Portal L3:** `starter/theme/starter-portal.css` via `importGuestPortalThemeForPlugin` (base), then workspace portal skins.

**Cross-surface rule:** portal bootstrap must not import marketing fallback CSS and vice versa.

**Workspace rule:** bootstrap trees must not contain workspace plugin selectors, `denali-*` / `urban-*` class names, or `@app-tour/workspace-*` imports.

## Runtime ingress (guest surfaces)

Guest portal and marketing **must not** wrap content in `TenantThemeProvider` for appearance. Workspace skin (L3) is the brand SSOT.

Allowed inline on `html` only:

- `--font-family-base` (font loading contract)

Allowed inline on components:

- Geometry tied to data (`width: N%` on progress fills)

Forbidden inline:

- `--color-*`, `--primary`, `--background`, `--border`, `--accent`, `--foreground`

Admin may use `TenantThemeProvider` under `/settings/branding` preview only (future); operator shell uses workspace skin + `WorkspaceThemeProvider` for `--ws-color-accent`.

## Enforcement

See [guard-css-integrity.md](../dev/guard-css-integrity.md):

- `guard-css-globals-import-only` — pre-commit
- `guard-css-bootstrap-integrity` — guest conformance bundle
- ESLint `no-inline-appearance-vars` on portal/marketing TSX

## Migration status (2026-07-06)

- Phase 1: bootstrap split (`portal-bootstrap`, `marketing-bootstrap`, `admin-bootstrap`)
- Phase 1: `denali-wizard-content-quality*` moved from platform CSS to Denali `wizard-review.css`
- Phase 1: guest providers drop `TenantThemeProvider`
- Phase 2: L2 structure-only fallbacks; portal `/me` appearance in starter `theme/starter-portal.css`; dynamic guest + admin theme loaders
